1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,390
Hi! This is a demo video.

2
00:00:05,620 --> 00:00:09,790
It was put together entirely by an
automated workflow.

3
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:16,140
First, the workflow looks at the commits
since the last video.

4
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:22,560
And builds an HTML script with the
episode's topics.

5
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:28,020
You record yourself on your phone,
vertically.

6
00:00:29,630 --> 00:00:33,640
Talk freely, the cuts come later.

7
00:00:35,010 --> 00:00:38,960
The transcription marks the time of every
word.

8
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:44,640
Meanwhile, the supporting footage gets
recorded.

9
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:49,440
The long video comes out with no burned
subtitles.

10
00:00:50,820 --> 00:00:55,940
The subtitles go to YouTube as files, in
each language.

11
00:00:57,240 --> 00:01:02,020
The Shorts get burned captions, word by
word.

12
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:08,280
And there are two versions, one in
Portuguese and one in English.

13
00:01:09,880 --> 00:01:14,760
First come light previews, and only then
the finals.

14
00:01:16,030 --> 00:01:17,080
That's it.

15
00:01:17,610 --> 00:01:20,220
Follow along for the next ones.

